Package: rustdesk-server
Version: 1.1.16
Architecture: amd64
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ericbyz <ericbyz@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: systemd
Description: Self-hosted RustDesk remote desktop relay (hbbs/hbbr)
 Run the RustDesk open-source server on the TNAS: hbbs (ID/signalling)
 and hbbr (relay) so remote-desktop sessions never leave your network.
 Ships a static instruction page (floating window in the TOS desktop)
 showing the client configuration and the server public key.
 Upstream project: https://github.com/rustdesk/rustdesk-server (AGPL-3.0),
 packaged unmodified.
